# Example App Structure

Reference only. Policy lives in [`startup_flow.mdc`](../startup_flow.mdc), [`navigation.mdc`](../navigation.mdc), [`state_management.mdc`](../state_management.mdc).

```dart
class App extends ConsumerWidget {
  const App({super.key});

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref) {
    final router = ref.watch(appRouterProvider);
    final themeMode = ref.watch(themeModeControllerProvider);
    final locale = ref.watch(localeControllerProvider);

    return MaterialApp.router(
      debugShowCheckedModeBanner: false,
      routerConfig: router,
      theme: AppTheme.light,
      darkTheme: AppTheme.dark,
      themeMode: themeMode,
      locale: locale,
      supportedLocales: AppLocalizations.supportedLocales,
      localizationsDelegates: AppLocalizations.localizationsDelegates,
    );
  }
}
```

- Keep `App` small; no service init in `build`.
- Watch only app-level providers.
- Single root: `MaterialApp.router`.
